The six Solidity files in this directory are copies, byte for byte, of
contracts/TaskToken.sol, contracts/TaskVault.sol and contracts/interfaces/*.sol of the
source at that commit. SHA256SUMS lists them; test/boundaries.test.js checks them.

Why they are here. The G1 adapter of this repository reads an ERC-8414 contract. Its tests
and the local run exercise it against the standard's own reference contract, unmodified,
not against a stand-in written for the purpose. The files are test fixtures: they are not
part of the PoUW protocol, nothing in the protocol's contracts imports them, and this
repository does not deploy them on a public chain - on Finchain the adapter is pointed at
the TaskToken that the covenant World already has.

To move to another commit of the standard: replace the files, update the commit above and
SHA256SUMS, and run the tests.
